811.4;+64,;1~WP-start~15
This computed finding will be true if the patient was/is an
inpatient on the evaluation date. The following "CSUB" values will
be available:

 ADMISSION DATE/TIME (FileMan format)
 ADMISSION TYPE
 ATTENDING PHYSICIAN
 DATE (FileMan format)
 PRIMARY PROVIDER
 TREATING SPECIALTY
 WARD LOCATION




